  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Engineering photography and clear reading",
    "overview": "This is a record of the implemented visual system, not a new identity or an inferred user commitment. The existing charcoal and ice-blue palette remains, paired with an off-white day theme. Real team vehicles, activities, and certificates provide the main visual evidence.\n\nPages use left-aligned headings, readable text, generous section spacing, and thin separators. The home page combines an asymmetric introduction and engineering photograph with direct routes to projects, records, news, and joining. Detail pages use quieter text-led layouts. These are distinct page compositions within the same system.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
